# Evolution Engine

Spec: Evolution
Purpose:
  Define the system evolution framework: how the .sdd system evolves
  itself through change records, why-changed attribution, migration
  tracking, and evolution health metrics. This enables architecture
  archaeology — answering "why does this code exist?" from historical
  context.

Owns: timeline/evolution.sdd

Change Record:
  @change.CH-204
  type: ARCHITECTURE
  from: modular-monolith@4
  to: modular-monolith@5
  reason: payment isolation
  decision: DEC-88
  impact:
    payment/*

Why Changed:
  Every change record MUST include a "why":

  WHY: Payment provider introduced asynchronous settlement.

  This is critical for future AI understanding.

Before/After:
  Before: Payment was synchronous.
  After: Payment settlement is asynchronous.
  Why: Provider latency and retry behavior.

  This human-readable format becomes valuable over time.

Architecture Archaeology:
  @skill.architecture-archaeology

  Input:
    code, git history, .sdd history, decisions, migrations

  Output:
    why this exists
    when introduced
    what problem it solved
    whether still valid

Evolution Health:
  New metric tracked:

  Evolution Health: 92%
  Stale skills: 3
  Pending migrations: 2
  Historical conflicts: 1
  Unresolved evolution debt: 4

Stale Knowledge Detection:
  Graph detects orphaned knowledge:
    @skill.old-payment
    references: 0
    used_by: 0
    status: DORMANT (not immediately deleted)

  Status levels: ACTIVE, DORMANT, DEPRECATED, ARCHIVED

Impact Analysis:
  Change to @concept.idempotency propagates through graph:
    affected skills: 4
    affected tasks: 12
    affected architecture decisions: 3
    affected docs: 8
    affected tests: 17

  Blast radius: HIGH

  If blast_radius = HIGH:
    Use plan → impact review → execute
  Instead of automatic execution.

Change Propagation:
  When DEC-88 is deprecated:
    find dependent skills
    find dependent tasks
    find dependent docs
    find dependent proofs
    → STALE_DEPENDENCY

  This connects to Knowledge Debt:
    OLD DECISION → DEPENDENT SKILL → OLD DOC → OLD TASK TEMPLATE
    If not updated → EVOLUTION_DEBT

Evolution Review:
  @skill.evolution-review

  When architecture changes:
    What changed?
    Why?
    What depends on it?
    What becomes stale?
    Which skills need update?
    Which docs need update?
    Which tests need update?

State: +
